// ============================================================================
// test_cad_v2.cpp — tests for the v2 CAD importers (ODB++, IPC-2581, KiCad,
// EAGLE, PADS, Allegro, Mentor neutral, FABmaster, DXF) plus archive.h and
// xml_lite.h. Sample data: tests/data/cad (generated by gen_cad_samples.py;
// the same synthetic board expressed in every format).
//
// Build (from repo root, see tests/run_all.sh):
//   g++ -std=c++20 -Isrc -Isdk tests/test_cad_v2.cpp src/plugins/*.cpp(excl. dll_win) src/io/*.cpp src/core/... -o test_cad_v2
// ============================================================================
